# ConnectOnion identity and session state
.co/
# Ignore only the per-user parts of the project bundle. The previous rule was
# `ConnectOnionMacClient.xcodeproj/*` with an allowlist, which excluded
# project.pbxproj — the file Xcode cannot open the project without. It survived
# in the inherited repository only because it had been committed before the rule
# existed, and tracked files ignore .gitignore. A fresh clone-and-commit dropped
# it, and CI failed with "missing its project.pbxproj file".
ConnectOnionMacClient.xcodeproj/xcuserdata/
ConnectOnionMacClient.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/

# Xcode per-user state
xcuserdata/
